  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MHPSS Expert with UNHCR Chad</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MHPSS is a major under-addressed need in the current emergency in East Sudan with an estimated 190,000 new arrivals in the last months. Many of them have experienced atrocities and hardships. There are urgent and immediate needs around MHPSS that should be addressed. The overall aim is to integrate MHPSS within the local humanitarian response.</narrative>
  </description>
